Selkies: several second displays at once (Wayland), each in its own place

Against Selkies 2.1.0 with this repo's other patches; applied after them by pkgs/selkies.nix.
Each page of a display number keeps its own screen; X11 keeps one secondary. README, "One app per screen".
The web client takes a page of any #displayN (N >= 2), not only #display2.
